    predicate: http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related
    rationale: The paragraph distinguishes the new entitlement decision from the overpayment recoverability
      decision for its listed benefits.
    evidence:
    - page: page/dmg-vol3-ch9/0004
      quote: "09024 Overpayments involving the benefits listed at DMG 09161 are only recoverable when the DM has\n\
        made\n\n\n1. a new entitlement decision1 (see DMG 09025) and\n\n\n2. an overpayment recoverability decision2
        (see DMG 09029).\n\n\n                                                              1 R(SB) 7/91; SS A Act
        92, s 71(5A); 2 s 71(2)"
      locator: DMG 09024
